{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-5a5cd50a4aad","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-5a5cd50a4aad","name":"清炒花菜","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E6%B8%85%E7%82%92%E8%8A%B1%E8%8F%9C.md","blob_sha":"4ab91b2c89cf0ef299377e643dba34f8012c98b6","details":{"introduction":"一道常见的家常素菜，口感脆嫩爽口。富含维生素 C 和膳食纤维。做法简单快捷，一般初学者仅需 15 分钟即可完成。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 花菜\n- 大蒜\n- 盐"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 2 个人食用（作为配菜）。\n\n每份：\n\n- 花菜 约 300 g （约 1/2 中等大小的花菜）\n- 大蒜 2-3 瓣\n- 盐 3 g\n- 食用油 15 ml\n- 饮用水 50 ml （用于炒制过程）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将 花菜 洗净，用刀或手掰成小朵，粗茎部分可以切片，备用。\n2. 将 大蒜 去皮，切成蒜片，备用。\n3. 锅中加入 1000 ml 饮用水，大火烧开。\n4. 放入 花菜 朵，煮 **2-3 分钟**，至花菜颜色变浅，口感稍微软化。\n5. 将 煮好的 花菜 捞出，沥干水分，备用。\n6. 热锅，加入 15 ml 食用油，大火烧热。\n7. 放入 蒜片，快速煸炒出香味。\n8. 放入 焯好水的 花菜 朵，转中大火，快速翻炒约 **2 分钟**，使花菜均匀受热。\n9. 加入 3 g 盐，继续翻炒均匀。\n10. 沿锅边淋入 50 ml 饮用水，盖上锅盖，焖 **1 分钟**，帮助花菜完全熟透入味。\n11. 开盖，快速翻炒均匀，即可出锅。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 提前将花菜焯水可以缩短炒制时间，并使花菜更容易熟透。\n- 炒制时间可以根据个人喜欢的花菜软硬程度调整。喜欢脆一些可以缩短时间。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：花菜400g、去皮大蒜12g、大豆食用油15g、食盐3g、饮用水40g；整份约350g。不先焯水，直接炒熟并保留全部汁液。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":71.565714,"protein_g":2.412343,"carbohydrate_g":6.814857,"fat_g":4.622857},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169986/nutrients","version":"0b85d491afd7200d","fdc_ids":[169986,169230,171411,173468,173647]},"profile_id":"family-5a5cd50a4aad-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-5a5cd50a4aad","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-5a5cd50a4aad","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-5a5cd50a4aad-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"cauliflower","grams":400},{"key":"garlic","grams":12},{"key":"oil","grams":15},{"key":"salt","grams":3},{"key":"water","grams":40}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"0b85d491afd7200d","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-5a5cd50a4aad-v1.700ca75aa7527641.json","bytes":23741,"sha256":"700ca75aa7527641b43a7db67f41f962415fb7328a4c61cf85ca6fa332c1401c"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-5a5cd50a4aad-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-5a5cd50a4aad","recipe_blob_sha":"4ab91b2c89cf0ef299377e643dba34f8012c98b6","version":"1","data_version":"0b85d491afd7200d","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":350,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品350g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：花菜400g、去皮大蒜12g、大豆食用油15g、食盐3g、饮用水40g；整份约350g。不先焯水，直接炒熟并保留全部汁液。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-5a5cd50a4aad","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-5a5cd50a4aad-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"cauliflower","grams":400},{"key":"garlic","grams":12},{"key":"oil","grams":15},{"key":"salt","grams":3},{"key":"water","grams":40}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":